/****************************************************************************
 * Name: st77916_bpp
 *
 * Description:
 *   Return the number of bits per pixel for the given framebuffer pixel
 *   format.  The driver supports only RGB565 (16-bit, FB_FMT_RGB16_565)
 *   and RGB666 (24-bit, FB_FMT_RGB24); any other format returns 0 and is
